{"3223650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trapped In The Omniverse", "steam_appid": 3223650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped In The Omniverse: The Infinite Confluence is a challenging first-person survival game that combines interdimensional exploration with adventure and survival. You find yourself lost in the mysterious Antechambers of Quantum Dynamics, where reality blends and distorts. Your mission is to restore the Cosmoportal, the only means to return home, while facing creatures and overcoming obstacles in a chaotic environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.poster.avif?t=1776111605\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.webm?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.mp4?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>With exploration mechanics, strategic combat, and resource management, every step brings you closer to uncovering the secrets of the multiverses and finding your way back home. Can you restore balance and find the exit before it’s too late?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/583dc39777b6a3e7c55381acf0bea0fa.avif?t=1776111605\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Dynamics was a pioneering company in quantum mechanics and its applications during its peak in the 70s and 80s. Their main focus was the unification of quantum physics with gravitational theory, and it is rumored they made significant advances in detecting multiverses and the possibility of traveling between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.poster.avif?t=1776111605\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.webm?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.mp4?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most notable discovery attributed to Quantum Dynamics was the existence of a connection between the Multiverses through the so-called Antechambers, also known by various names according to documentation found in their old facilities. These antechambers, such as the Omniverse Chamber, the Cosmoportal Nexus, the Infinite Confluence, the Dimensional Nexus Hub, the Quantum Echo Chamber, or the Transdimensional Sanctum, allowed interaction between different universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within these antechambers, it was found that the atmospheres of both Multiverses mixed, creating an environment conducive to the construction of habitable structures. The cross-contamination between parallel realities made these structures livable and allowed for simultaneous existence in both multiverses.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/eba16cddc8682a530e14c4d11c481fe7.avif?t=1776111605\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras_big/eba16cddc8682a530e14c4d11c481fe7.avif?t=1776111605 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Quantum Dynamics began to face significant problems as the antechambers became increasingly contaminated. The company could not maintain control over the presence of specimens and elements from both Multiverses, leading to the gradual abandonment of the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite its disappearance and the loss of records about Quantum Dynamics' activities, the abandoned remains of the company and the documentation found within them remain silent witnesses to a fascinating period in multiverse exploration and attempts to overcome dimensional barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of Quantum Dynamics, an independent team of daring researchers embarked on a mission to unravel the hidden mysteries behind the company and its legacy. Through meticulous research and exploration of abandoned facilities, they discovered a wealth of written and video material shedding light on Quantum Dynamics’ work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the most surprising findings were numerous documents and records detailing the antechambers used by the company. These antechambers, commonly known by Roman numerals, were not limited to a few. Instead, it was discovered that Quantum Dynamics had managed to build and catalog dozens of interconnected antechambers, each with its own unique features and properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/c4a55cf2a917b62b347c3546c1d70788.avif?t=1776111605\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras_big/c4a55cf2a917b62b347c3546c1d70788.avif?t=1776111605 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each antechamber presented a specific configuration, with varying dimensions and distinctive characteristics. Some were expansive, covering vast stretches extending across thousands of square kilometers in both multiverses. Others were more compact, limited to a few hundred acres but with an incredible concentration of quantum energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The researchers discovered that these numbered antechambers were not only connection points between multiverses but also key nodes for understanding the structure and very nature of reality. Each antechamber seemed to contain fragments of information and knowledge that transcended the limits of any individual universe, revealing fascinating aspects of quantum physics and existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they delved deeper into the recovered files, the research team also found mentions of an even more ambitious expansion project known as &quot;Project Omega.&quot; This project, which remained unfinished after Quantum Dynamics' disappearance, aimed to create a definitive antechamber capable of connecting multiple multiverses simultaneously. Speculations and hypotheses about the implications and potential applications of such a project flooded the researchers' minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/38143310bc50839dfaec2743aa868598.avif?t=1776111605\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras_big/38143310bc50839dfaec2743aa868598.avif?t=1776111605 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The writings and videos uncovered showed indications of the difficulties Quantum Dynamics faced in maintaining control over existing antechambers. The cross-contamination of multiverse atmospheres appeared to be a constant challenge, affecting the balance and habitability of the structures built within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The researchers realized that these findings could have significant implications for the future of interdimensional exploration. The possibility of accessing dozens of antechambers and the incomplete vision of Project Omega sparked new questions and possibilities about the nature of the multiverses and the potential for traveling through them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the research team delved into this wealth of information, they understood that their discovery had the potential to change humanity’s understanding of the universe and its place within it. The enigmas and secrets locked within the numbered antechambers offered a glimpse into the limits of reality, challenging conventional physics and opening doors to new horizons of exploration and discovery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped In The Omniverse: The Infinite Confluence is a challenging first-person survival game that combines interdimensional exploration with adventure and survival. You find yourself lost in the mysterious Antechambers of Quantum Dynamics, where reality blends and distorts. Your mission is to restore the Cosmoportal, the only means to return home, while facing creatures and overcoming obstacles in a chaotic environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.poster.avif?t=1776111605\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.webm?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/ae1bf745f2d1e6b20e103040e4826d6d.mp4?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>With exploration mechanics, strategic combat, and resource management, every step brings you closer to uncovering the secrets of the multiverses and finding your way back home. Can you restore balance and find the exit before it’s too late?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/583dc39777b6a3e7c55381acf0bea0fa.avif?t=1776111605\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Dynamics was a pioneering company in quantum mechanics and its applications during its peak in the 70s and 80s. Their main focus was the unification of quantum physics with gravitational theory, and it is rumored they made significant advances in detecting multiverses and the possibility of traveling between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.poster.avif?t=1776111605\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.webm?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/168445d1d9bb8030f58900631974d5a8.mp4?t=1776111605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most notable discovery attributed to Quantum Dynamics was the existence of a connection between the Multiverses through the so-called Antechambers, also known by various names according to documentation found in their old facilities. These antechambers, such as the Omniverse Chamber, the Cosmoportal Nexus, the Infinite Confluence, the Dimensional Nexus Hub, the Quantum Echo Chamber, or the Transdimensional Sanctum, allowed interaction between different universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within these antechambers, it was found that the atmospheres of both Multiverses mixed, creating an environment conducive to the construction of habitable structures. The cross-contamination between parallel realities made these structures livable and allowed for simultaneous existence in both multiverses.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/eba16cddc8682a530e14c4d11c481fe7.avif?t=1776111605\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras_big/eba16cddc8682a530e14c4d11c481fe7.avif?t=1776111605 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Quantum Dynamics began to face significant problems as the antechambers became increasingly contaminated. The company could not maintain control over the presence of specimens and elements from both Multiverses, leading to the gradual abandonment of the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite its disappearance and the loss of records about Quantum Dynamics' activities, the abandoned remains of the company and the documentation found within them remain silent witnesses to a fascinating period in multiverse exploration and attempts to overcome dimensional barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of Quantum Dynamics, an independent team of daring researchers embarked on a mission to unravel the hidden mysteries behind the company and its legacy. Through meticulous research and exploration of abandoned facilities, they discovered a wealth of written and video material shedding light on Quantum Dynamics’ work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the most surprising findings were numerous documents and records detailing the antechambers used by the company. These antechambers, commonly known by Roman numerals, were not limited to a few. Instead, it was discovered that Quantum Dynamics had managed to build and catalog dozens of interconnected antechambers, each with its own unique features and properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/c4a55cf2a917b62b347c3546c1d70788.avif?t=1776111605\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras_big/c4a55cf2a917b62b347c3546c1d70788.avif?t=1776111605 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each antechamber presented a specific configuration, with varying dimensions and distinctive characteristics. Some were expansive, covering vast stretches extending across thousands of square kilometers in both multiverses. Others were more compact, limited to a few hundred acres but with an incredible concentration of quantum energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The researchers discovered that these numbered antechambers were not only connection points between multiverses but also key nodes for understanding the structure and very nature of reality. Each antechamber seemed to contain fragments of information and knowledge that transcended the limits of any individual universe, revealing fascinating aspects of quantum physics and existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they delved deeper into the recovered files, the research team also found mentions of an even more ambitious expansion project known as &quot;Project Omega.&quot; This project, which remained unfinished after Quantum Dynamics' disappearance, aimed to create a definitive antechamber capable of connecting multiple multiverses simultaneously. Speculations and hypotheses about the implications and potential applications of such a project flooded the researchers' minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223650/extras/38143310b